<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>NiFi connection</title>
  <style>
    :root { --ok: #15803d; --bad: #b91c1c; --warn: #b45309; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      font: 15px/1.5 ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
      background: #f7f5f1;
      color: #1a1a1a;
    }
    .card {
      width: min(560px, 92vw);
      background: #fff;
      border: 1px solid #f0c7c7;
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 28px 24px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(185, 28, 28, .08);
    }
    h1 {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      font-size: 20px;
      color: var(--bad);
    }
    .banner {
      margin: 0 0 14px;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: #fdecea;
      color: var(--bad);
      font-weight: 650;
    }
    p { margin: 0 0 10px; color: #4b5563; }
    code {
      font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
      font-size: 12.5px;
      background: #f3f4f6;
      padding: 1px 5px;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }
    .hint { color: var(--warn); }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="card">
    <h1>NiFi connection</h1>
    <p class="banner">NiFi is not reachable through this proxy</p>
    <p>
      This is <code>https://HOST:${NIFI_PROXY_HOST_PORT}</code>
      (<code>nifi-proxy</code>). Upstream is
      <code>${NIFI_UPSTREAM}</code>.
    </p>
    <p class="hint">
      The live canvas is <code>https://HOST:8443/nifi</code>.
      Open that if you passed <code>--nifi-url</code>, or wait for the
      compose NiFi container to finish booting (1–3 minutes) and retry
      <code>https://HOST:${NIFI_PROXY_HOST_PORT}/nifi</code>.
    </p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
